WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:06.960
What's up guys!

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:07.920
We are Pongfinity!

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:10.740
Today we are playing a tournament
with the bottom of the racket.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.420
To five points, 0-0.

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:14.080
Yea, and no two point difference.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.080
What was that!
Sorry!

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:40.300
Look how low he is!

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:43.360
He is really in the position I have never seen that before!

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:05.900
What? He played it like off the side!

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:23.660
I'm sorry Otto!

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:41.600
What can you do...

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:42.960
He's just putting it on

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:51.480
Yeah there we have the smash!

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.100
I tried to distract you there!

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:00.220
I don't know what that was

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:17.100
Wait wait!

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:42.220
Look at that!

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:44.000
How is that even possible?

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.240
That was the shot of the day!

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:51.480
I knew it!

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:59.540
I never thought that playing with the
butt of the racket could be this intense!

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:26.160
Hahahaha, sorry!

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:44.440
Injury time out for Emil!

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:45.460
We need a medic!

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:47.417
So we had our medical team have a look at it

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:50.600
I got some like eight to ten stitches and now I'm ready.

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:10.300
It came straight to my mind
that I don't want to risk it!

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:26.940
Sensei is back!

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:29.380
It was a good match but a tight match.

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:32.820
You gave everything you got,
even a piece of your skin!

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:34.880
Don't forget to hit subscribe

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:36.760
and watch our previous episodes there!

00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:39.920
Until next time!

